<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103284" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεταρτ-αῖος</span></b> , 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετόρταιος</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			30.2
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the fourth day</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. γενέσθαι</span> to be <i>four
			days</i> dead, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.89
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφικνεῖσθαι τεταρταίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					616b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. πυρετός</span>
			<i>quartan</i> fever, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				86a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῖγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1151.37
				</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v A.D.)</span>; so without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				2.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1088.38
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετῷ καὶ τεταρταίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.1424
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. πονεῖσθαι</span> to have fits
				<i>every four days</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Judic.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτὰ τεταρταίῳ μῆνας ἔκαμνε πυρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.</u>
					3.1.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύτρα τεταρταίοιο δυσαλγέος οὕνεκα
					παῦσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Rev.Bibl.</u>
					14.295
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Lycia</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεταρταίη,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τετάρτη</span>
			, <i>the fourth day</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				806
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>quartan fever</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				635
			</span></i>.</div>
